{"ref":"BDB, מַלְכִּיָּהוּ","hw":"מַלְכִּיָּהוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכִּיָּהוּ</span></big>  (only <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.6\">Je 38:6</a>), <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכִּיָּה</span> <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>my king is Yah</em>;<strong>)</strong> cf. Gray<sup>Prop. N. 119 f., 146 al.</sup>;—𝔊 Μελχ(ε)ια(ς).—<br><strong>1.</strong>  father of Pashhur <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 21:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.21.1\">Je 21:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.1\">38:1</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.12\">1 Ch 9:12</a> (priest), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:12\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.12\">Ne 11:12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a prince <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.6\">Je 38:6</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  priests: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.9\">I Ch 24:9</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:42\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.42\">Ne 12:42</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  one of the sealed <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.4\">Ne 10:4</a>; perhaps also <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.4\">8:4</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  a Levite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.25\">1 Ch 6:25</a>.<br><strong>6.</strong>  various men: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:25\" href=\"/Ezra.10.25\">Ezr 10:25a</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:25\" href=\"/Ezra.10.25\">Ezr 10:25b</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:31\" href=\"/Ezra.10.31\">Ezr 10:31</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.11\">Ne 3:11</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:14\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.14\">Ne 3:14</a>. <strong>e.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:31\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.31\">Ne 3:31</a>.","next":"BDB, מַלְכִּי־צֶ֫דֶק","prev":"BDB, מַלְכִּיאֵלִי"}